  $ wi (wa (wa ph ps) ch) th $ >
  $ wi (wa (wa (wa ph ta) ps) ch) th $;

--| Deduction adding a conjunct to antecedent. (Contributed by NM, 26-Dec-2004.) (Proof shortened by Wolf Lammen, 4-Dec-2012.)
theorem adantlrl (ph ps ch th ta: wff):
  $ wi (wa (wa ph ps) ch) th $ >
