theorem simpll1 (ph ps ch th ta: wff):
  $ wi (wa (wa (w3a ph ps ch) th) ta) ph $;

--| Simplification of conjunction. (Contributed by NM, 9-Mar-2012.)
theorem simpll2 (ph ps ch th ta: wff):
  $ wi (wa (wa (w3a ph ps ch) th) ta) ps $;

