theorem addsubassi (A2 B2 C: class):
  $ wcel A2 cc $ >
  $ wcel B2 cc $ >
  $ wcel C cc $ >
  $ wceq (co (co A2 B2 caddc) C cmin) (co A2 (co B2 C cmin) caddc) $;

--| Law for subtraction and addition. (Contributed by NM, 6-Aug-2003.)
theorem addsubi (A2 B2 C: class):
  $ wcel A2 cc $ >
