theorem lt0neg1d (ph: wff) (A2: class):
  $ wi ph (wcel A2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wb (wbr A2 cc0 clt) (wbr cc0 (cneg A2) clt)) $;

--| Comparison of a number and its negative to zero. (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 27-May-2016.)
