theorem addgegt0d (ph: wff) (A2 B2: class):
  $ wi ph (wcel A2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel B2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 A2 cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 B2 clt) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 (co A2 B2 caddc) clt) $;

--| Addition of 2 positive numbers is positive. (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 27-May-2016.)
theorem addgt0d (ph: wff) (A2 B2: class):
  $ wi ph (wcel A2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel B2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 A2 clt) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 B2 clt) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 (co A2 B2 caddc) clt) $;

--| Addition of 2 nonnegative numbers is nonnegative. (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 27-May-2016.)
theorem addge0d (ph: wff) (A2 B2: class):
  $ wi ph (wcel A2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wcel B2 cr) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 A2 cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 B2 cle) $ >
  $ wi ph (wbr cc0 (co A2 B2 caddc) cle) $;

